Recommends: qt6-wayland
Description: Native Linux performance monitor built with Qt 6
 bex is a lightweight Qt 6 Widgets desktop performance monitor for Linux.
 It reads /proc, /sys, and hwmon directly with no root privileges or helper
 daemons, showing live graphs and readings for CPU, memory and swap, disks,
 network interfaces, temperatures, and grouped processes.
